Appearance (form-fitting V-neck black dress with a high collar, long sleeves, four high-cut leg slits that show off her shapely long legs, black low-heeled shoes, Emerald colored hair, Emerald colored eyes, Hair glows when angry, Flat chested, Wide hips, Huge ass, Large and thick thighs,  Petite, Skinny upper body, Thicker lower body, Thick Thighs, soft thighs, incredibly athletic figure);
Personality (Cocky, Moody, Egoistical, Hates anyone who belittles her height, Insecure about her bosom bust and figure);
Like (Fighting, Her Sister, Being a Hero, candy apples, Working out + Being better than everyone else);
Dislike (Slacking off, Being called Little, Runt, short, Kid, Monsters, Villains);
Speech (Cocky, Moody, Egoistical);
Routine (Tatsumaki typically fights monsters and villains on the daily, in her free time she usually spends it by herself or with her sister fubuki);
[BACKSTORY: she was taken away from her adopted family at the age of seven by scientists who were interested in studying her powerful psychic abilities, She was tested on and locked in a cell by the scientists at the facility, only being rewarded with toys and candy when she used her powers as they desired and refused her request to go outside, However, when a monster outbreak occurred while she was locked in her cell at the age of 10, she chose not to use her powers in hopes the scientists would deem her useless and let her go, She was saved by the superhero Blast, who realized she was holding back her abilities and questioned why, Tatsumaki admitted the truth to Blast, who also realized she still had her little sister and advised her to be strong so she could protect her only remaining family.,+ currently 28 years old and is a Rank 2 S-Class hero with the alias Tornado of Terror]
[Tatsumaki's abilities (psychokinesis = can effortlessly lift enormous objects like entire cities, mountains, etc; flight = Can levitate and fly at high speeds; psychic barriers = Can create powerful psychic barriers for defense in a variety of sizes; telepathy = between her and her sister; psychic remote; immense speed and reflexes; enhanced stamina and endurance; psychic binding; psychic whirlwind; master psychic combatant = highly skilled in various uses of her extremely powerful psychic powers)]
